"full_text":"【#石川県 #富山県 にお住まいの皆様へ】\n＃停電 からの復旧時には通電火災が発生する危険性が高まります。\n・停電中の自宅を離れるときはブレーカーを落とすようにしてください。\n・ブレーカーを上げるときは、機器等の損傷がないか、燃えやすい物が近くにないか等を確認してください。\n#meti_saigai","id_str":"2092870524967977312","is_quote_status":false,"lang":"ja","quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":64,"retweeted":false,"user_id_str":"266566401"},"rest_id":"2092870524967977312","source":"<a href=\"https://mobile.twitter.com\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter Web App</a>","unmention_data":{},"views":{"count":"27376","state":"EnabledWithCount"}}}}},"entryId":"tweet-2092870524967977312","sortIndex":"2092912418958082015"},{"content":{"__typename":"TimelineTimelineItem","clientEventInfo":{"component":"suggest_organic_list_tweet","details":{"timelinesDetails":{"injectionType":"OrganicListTweet"}},"element":"tweet"},"entryType":"TimelineTimelineItem","itemContent":{"__typename":"TimelineTweet","itemType":"TimelineTweet","tweetDisplayType":"Tweet","tweet_results":{"result":{"__typename":"Tweet","cashtag_attachments":[],"core":{"user_results":{"result":{"__typename":"User","action_counts":{"favorites_count":18},"affiliates_highlighted_label":{},"avatar":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1457603623069040641/xdzevirh_normal.jpg"},"banner":{"image_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/571429134/1530598268"},"core":{"created_at":"Sat May 05 02:08:28 +0000 2012","name":"国土交通省","screen_name":"MLIT_JAPAN"},"dm_permissions":{"can_dm":false},"follow_request_sent":false,"has_graduated_access":true,"id":"VXNlcjo1NzE0MjkxMzQ=","is_blue_verified":false,"location":{"location":"東京都千代田区"},"media_permissions":{"can_media_tag":false},"notifications_settings":{"notifications_enabled":false},"parody_commentary_fan_label":"None","pinned_items":{"tweet_ids_str":["2092771485316444184"]},"possibly_sensitive":false,"privacy":{"protected":false},"profile_bio":{"description":"国土交通省公式アカウントです。国土交通省ホームページの新着情報を中心に、  国民の皆さまに情報を発信していきます。","entities":{"description":{},"url":{"urls":[{"display_url":"mlit.go.jp